the realm  do you know what the realm is  it's the thousand blades of aegon's  enemies  a story we agreed to tell each other  over  and over till we forget that it's a lie  what's up ladies and gentlemen welcome  back for another game of thrones and  house of the dragon update video in this  video i want to show you what our old  friend george rr martin had to say  before hbo aired its first episode of  house of the dragon last night for those  of you who haven't seen it it looks like  he had one final message before the show  went out to millions of fans all over  the realm  let's head on over to george rr martin's  not a blog website so you can see what  he had to say he said the dragons are  here tonight's the night it has been  three years since game of thrones wound  up its run on hbo and way way longer  since we began the development of the  successor series that eventually became  house of the dragon you have been  reading all about it for days or weeks  or months depending on how much you  follow the news out of westeros me i've  done more interviews than i can count we  had a huge panel in hall h at san diego  comic con and red carpet events in los  angeles amsterdam london india sweden  and right here in santa fe at my cinema  there's an amazing 3d billboard in new  york city overlooking times square  there's more content on youtube than  anyone can keep track of archmaester  gildane's history fire and blood is back  on the bestseller list in climbing you  can get a signed copy from beastly books  reviews have been coming in most good  some bad i don't know what else i can  say except house of the dragon airs  tonight on hbo and hbo max  now what george actually says next makes  me think he might have been a little  excited and nervous about the first  episode finally airing on hbo he said  whatever happens from here my sincere  thanks go out to ryan condell and miguel  sapochnick to one of the most  astonishing casts it has ever been my  honor to work with an incredible crew to  an amazing writing staff to my friends  at hbo past and present who have worked  for years to bring hot d to fruition and  to the fans without whom none of this  would have happened and a tip of my cap  to my editors publishers and readers as  well it all began 40 odd years ago with  a book  watch the show i hope you'll enjoy it  now it's insane to actually think that  george rr martin began this story nearly  40 years ago when he first envisioned  the scene where the starks find their  direwolves in the late summer snows and  now we're here with many best-selling  novels later one massively successful  show in game of thrones arguably the  most successful show ever and now this  new show with house of the dragon it's  amazing to think how we're finally here  even after game of thrones had such a  divisive ending this fandom is so strong  there's still millions and millions of  fans like me and you who are ready for  more and then some  now the reason why i think he was a  little nervous is because of how he said  whatever happens from here he wants to  thank everyone who was involved with  making the show he knows that letting  the news outlets review the show early  is one thing but showing the first  episode and eventually the whole first  season to the entire world is something  entirely different i mean he knows  better than anyone if the fans do not  like house of the dragon they will not  be afraid to let him and everyone else  who worked on it know exactly how they  feel like i said in my video last night  i think they did a great job with the  first episode now it might not have had  one of those standout moments like the  white walkers reveal but it still did an  amazing job at introducing us to all of  these characters their relationships  with one another and their own conflicts  and desires i believe this show will  only get better from here on out if  you've read fire and blood you  definitely know about all the amazing  moments that are heading our way also in  another one of george rr martin's recent  interviews he said he will no longer  guess at when he will release the ones  of winter if you know his history then  you know he sucks at guessing whenever  he will finish his novels all it ends up  doing is making the fans even more angry  whenever he misses a deadline he said i  do find it a little grisly whenever fans  speculate online about what's gonna  happen to the rest of my novels after i  die i don't feel close to dying well  george if it means anything to you i do  hope that you live forever i also think  it's a little disrespectful whenever  fans discuss what might happen with the  winds of winter or even a dream of  spring when he dies  now that house of the dragon is finally  here how many of you would rather have  the ones of winter instead of the new  show if you actually did have the option  of having one or the other which one  would you want right now i am wondering  if house of the dragon's first episode  had any effect whatsoever on what the  fans actually want now i'm sure most of  the book readers would rather have the  ones of winter but i am wondering if it  even matters to those of you who haven't  read them let me know your thoughts down  below also i have a lot more videos that  i will be releasing this week if you  haven't already make sure you subscribe  so you're the first to know whenever i  release a new video i still have my full  breakdown in review on the way as always  i want to thank everyone for watching  this video i hope you all have a great  day i will see you again very soon bye  so  [Music]  you

